[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3060.79, "timestamp": "00:51:00", "text": "。 没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3063.03, "timestamp": "00:51:03", "text": "反向罗拉克斯。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3065.51, "timestamp": "00:51:05", "text": "。 记住，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3067.27, "timestamp": "00:51:07", "text": "有些树木，尤其是在澳大利亚，可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3070.309, "timestamp": "00:51:10", "text": "通过火繁殖。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3071.67, "timestamp": "00:51:11", "text": "它们就像是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3074.39, "timestamp": "00:51:14", "text": "处决树木的陪审团。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3076.39, "timestamp": "00:51:16", "text": "这很常见，而且我认为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3078.309, "timestamp": "00:51:18", "text": "众所周知，树木在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3080.069, "timestamp": "00:51:20", "text": "周围所有植物都被杀死后反而会长得更好，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3082.87, "timestamp": "00:51:22", "text": "甚至连它们自己也杀死了。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3084.4, "timestamp": "00:51:24", "text": "。   是的 。 就像他们在某个地方喜欢那样。是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3091.75, "timestamp": "00:51:31", "text": "。 实际上，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3094.309, "timestamp": "00:51:34", "text": "种植园就是这么做的，因为嗯……我以前住在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3097.67, "timestamp": "00:51:37", "text": "农场，每次收割后，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3099.75, "timestamp": "00:51:39", "text": "我们都会把整片麦田烧掉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3100.87, "timestamp": "00:51:40", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3103.19, "timestamp": "00:51:43", "text": "嗯，它对田地来说其实真的很好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3105.19, "timestamp": "00:51:45", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3106.71, "timestamp": "00:51:46", "text": "在这里，他们称之为让"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3108.71, "timestamp": "00:51:48", "text": "鸟儿休息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3110.15, "timestamp": "00:51:50", "text": "让大地休憩。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3113.349, "timestamp": "00:51:53", "text": "。 通过焚烧。"}, {"type": "subt